  "body": "### Summary\nAs the maintainer, I want switches that no longer switch and code only tests use removed, so that a reader does not reason about paths that cannot occur and tests do not compare the code with itself (LESSONS 2).\n\n### Evidence (`7a61018f`)\n- `App/SwiftHFR/Root/RootTab.swift:83-92`: `owningLot` returns nil for every case, so `isBuilt` is always true; neither has a caller in `App/SwiftHFR` or `App/SwiftHFRTests`.\n- `App/SwiftHFR/Experimental/ExperimentalFeature.swift:40`: `var isListed: Bool { true }`, still branched on at `ExperimentalSettings.swift:22,28` and `ExperimentalFeature.swift:110`; `App/SwiftHFRTests/Experimental/ExperimentalSettingsTests.swift:40,43,63` assert `allSatisfy { $0.isListed }` and `listed == allCases.filter(\\.isListed)`.\n- `App/SwiftHFR/Experimental/ModernComposer/ComposerChrome.swift:74-79`: `static let current: ComposerToolStyle = .pills`; its doc says the other variant \"is then deleted\" once the operator chose; the only reader is `Composer/ComposerControlRow.swift:104`.\n- `App/SwiftHFR/Root/RootModel.swift:153`: `favoritesStartupSource` is used by test suites only (e.g. `RootModelTests.swift:21`, `MPNotificationOpenTests.swift:28`) and by no app code; the app passes `TopicSource(mode: options.mode)` (`RootModel.swift:209`), so those suites build a Favoris tab the app never builds in \"Favoris uniquement\" mode.\n- `App/SwiftHFR/Common/HapticFeedback.swift:37-40`: `notification(_:)` has no app caller, only `HapticFeedbackTests`.\n\n### Fix\nDelete `owningLot`/`isBuilt`, `isListed` and its guards, `ComposerToolStyle.plain`/`current` (confirm first that the pills choice of #895 is recorded), `HapticFeedback.notification`; make the tests build their root as the app does and delete `favoritesStartupSource`; drop the three tautological expectations.\n\n### Test\nNone new: the existing suites compile and pass after the change.\n\nRework model: Haiku 5.5, reviewed by Opus 5.5.\n\nFound by #775 (cloud/r775-fable, Fable 5.2). Reviewed at `dev-swift` @ `7a61018f`; read from the code, not run on a device unless stated.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
