   "body": "/claim cloud/fb-quickwins-sonnet\n\nPlan (one PR, after #1199):\n- Delete the dead switches and test-only code listed in the issue (`PlusEntry.owningLot`/`isBuilt`, `ExperimentalFeature.isListed` and its guards, `ComposerToolStyle.plain`/`current` once the pills choice of #895 is confirmed recorded, `HapticFeedback.notification`) and the tautological expectations; make the suites build their root as the app does and delete `RootModel.favoritesStartupSource`.\n- **Overlap to order:** #1231 (open) adds `RootModelSessionChangeTests`, which uses `RootModel.favoritesStartupSource`; #1240 touches `ComposerChrome.swift` (another hunk, line 67). So this PR should merge after #1231 (I merge `dev-swift` and adapt that test then) and I keep the `ComposerChrome.swift` hunk apart from #1240's.\n- No new test: the existing suites must compile and pass.\n- Draft PR with `compile-check`, Opus adversarial review, ready line on #893.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
